{"id":2220,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:46","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2220"},"modified":"2025-10-02T09:03:14","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T09:03:14","slug":"tiny-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/tiny-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Tiny Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"51\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"51\">Custom Tiny Cardboard Boxes at Wholesale Prices<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"356\">We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em data-start=\"59\" data-end=\"81\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a> offer well-constructed, customizable <strong data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"143\">tiny cardboard boxes<\/strong> to meet a wide variety of packaging needs. Whether you&#8217;re packing jewelry, small accessories, tiny electronics, cosmetic samples, or keepsakes, these compact boxes offer a protective, neat, and professional look.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"648\">If you\u2019re sourcing packaging in bulk, our <strong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"444\">tiny cardboard boxes at wholesale prices<\/strong> offer the right mix of quality and affordability. You can request your preferred size, finish, and design while enjoying added services like free design support, fast production, and nationwide shipping.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"653\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"697\">Tiny Packaging Built for Maximum Impact<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"699\" data-end=\"741\">Ideal for Compact Product Presentation<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"996\">Our tiny cardboard boxes are made from high-quality materials like white SBS, Kraft board, or corrugated E-flute, offering strength while maintaining a clean structure. These boxes help brands present products neatly while also minimizing shipping bulk.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1208\">\n<li data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1083\">\n<p data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1083\">Suited for items like earrings, pins, tiny glass bottles, tea samplers, and vials<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1153\">\n<p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1153\">Perfect for gift wrapping, branded samples, or subscription boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1208\">\n<p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1208\">Flat-packed delivery for easy storage and assembly<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1347\">We manufacture boxes in dimensions starting as small as 1.5&#8243; x 1.5&#8243; and offer customization up to several inches depending on your needs.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1396\">Designed to Fit Small But Valuable Contents<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1567\">Each tiny box is engineered to protect what\u2019s inside. From sturdy base folds to secure closures, these boxes maintain integrity in both retail and shipping environments.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Dimensions<\/td>\n<td>Starting from 1.5&#8243; x 1.5&#8243;, up to small square or rectangular custom sizes<\/td>\n<td>White SBS, Kraft Board, Corrugated E-flute<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Custom die-cuts, tear strips, perforations<\/td>\n<td>Retail products, gift boxes, sample kits<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Materials Available<\/td>\n<td>Strong, durable, and eco-friendly board stock<\/td>\n<td>White SBS, Kraft Board, E-Flute Corrugated<\/td>\n<td>Matte Lamination, Aqueous Coating<\/td>\n<td>Recycled content, compostable stock<\/td>\n<td>Food, cosmetics, electronics, apparel<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Options<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Inside &amp; Outside Panel Printing<\/td>\n<td>10pt\u201328pt Paperboard, Kraft, Coated Stocks<\/td>\n<td>Anti-scratch, Soft Touch, Metallic Foil<\/td>\n<td>QR codes, barcodes, inside prints<\/td>\n<td>Branding, promotions, safety instructions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Choices<\/td>\n<td>Protects surface and enhances look<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Soft Touch, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Foil Stamping, Embossing, Debossing<\/td>\n<td>Scratch resistance, waterproof layer<\/td>\n<td>Luxury goods, premium packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Closure Styles<\/td>\n<td>Multiple secure and functional options<\/td>\n<td>Tuck End, Seal End, Auto Lock, 2-Piece Lid<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss, Aqueous<\/td>\n<td>Easy-open tabs, locking flaps<\/td>\n<td>Shipping, retail shelves, display packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features<\/td>\n<td>Enhanced structural and visual options<\/td>\n<td>Foam inserts, paper dividers, inner liners<\/td>\n<td>Lamination, Textured Surfaces<\/td>\n<td>Windows, cut-outs, custom shapes<\/td>\n<td>Electronics, bakery, jewelry, apparel<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Food Safe Options<\/td>\n<td>FDA-compliant, non-toxic coatings<\/td>\n<td>Kraft Paper, Food-Safe White Board<\/td>\n<td>Matte\/Gloss Coating, Soft Touch<\/td>\n<td>Grease-resistant lining, odor barriers<\/td>\n<td>Bakery, chocolates, ready-to-eat meals<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MOQ<\/td>\n<td>Starts at 100 Units<\/td>\n<td>Flexible for small &amp; bulk orders<\/td>\n<td>All finishes available<\/td>\n<td>Tiered pricing for wholesale<\/td>\n<td>Startups, SMEs, large-scale brands<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Proofing Options<\/td>\n<td>Flat View, 3D Mock-up, Physical Sample<\/td>\n<td>Digital\/Offset Stock Proofs<\/td>\n<td>Spot UV, Matte, Gloss<\/td>\n<td>Artwork adjustments, free revisions<\/td>\n<td>Final approval before bulk production<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days Standard, Rush Production Optional<\/td>\n<td>Depends on size &amp; material chosen<\/td>\n<td>Premium finishes may extend time<\/td>\n<td>Priority shipping upgrades<\/td>\n<td>Urgent events, product launches<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Delivery<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated mailers for protection<\/td>\n<td>Standard or Premium Finish<\/td>\n<td>Tracking codes, secure packaging<\/td>\n<td>Safe transport of goods<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Services<\/td>\n<td>Free Layout and Artwork Assistance Included<\/td>\n<td>Digital templates, dielines provided<\/td>\n<td>Foil, Emboss, Deboss<\/td>\n<td>Logo placement, typography setup<\/td>\n<td>Professional brand presentation<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3148\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3150\" data-end=\"3205\">Round Cardboard Boxes and Other Small Format Options<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"3207\" data-end=\"3243\">Expanding Your Box Style Options<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3245\" data-end=\"3479\">While square and rectangular shapes are common, we also manufacture <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/round-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3338\">round cardboard boxes<\/strong><\/a> for tiny-sized products. These are widely used in the cosmetic, gift, and food sectors for items like balms, dry goods, mints, or ornaments.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3614\">\n<li data-start=\"3481\" data-end=\"3529\">\n<p data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3529\">Customizable lids and bases in round formats<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3573\">\n<p data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3573\">Option to include paper or foam inserts<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3614\">\n<p data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3614\">Full printing across curved surfaces<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3742\">If your brand focuses on presentation and compact packaging, round boxes offer an elegant option alongside traditional shapes.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"3744\" data-end=\"3777\">Common Uses Across Industries<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3818\">Tiny cardboard boxes are often used by:<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"4025\">\n<li data-start=\"3820\" data-end=\"3854\">\n<p data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"3854\">Jewelry and accessory sellers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3855\" data-end=\"3886\">\n<p data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3886\">Health and wellness brands<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3887\" data-end=\"3917\">\n<p data-start=\"3890\" data-end=\"3917\">Corporate gifting vendors<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3965\">\n<p data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"3965\">Online retailers offering promotional kits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3966\" data-end=\"4025\">\n<p data-start=\"3969\" data-end=\"4025\">Subscription services needing branded sample packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"4027\" data-end=\"4159\">These boxes offer the benefit of a small footprint, making them easy to store, transport, and hand out at events or retail counters.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4161\" data-end=\"4164\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4213\">Coating, Printing, and Customization Options<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"4215\" data-end=\"4244\">Premium Finishing Options<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4453\">Make your packaging stand out with our high-end finishing features. Whether you want a sleek look or added durability, our coating options are designed to improve the visual and physical quality of each box.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4455\" data-end=\"4603\">\n<li data-start=\"4455\" data-end=\"4501\">\n<p data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4501\">Gloss finish for smooth and shiny surfaces<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4552\">\n<p data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4552\">Matte finish for a softer, non-reflective feel<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4603\">\n<p data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4603\">Spot UV to highlight specific graphics or text<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4605\" data-end=\"4682\">All coatings are applied with precision to avoid warping or fading over time.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"4715\">Custom Printing Made Simple<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4717\" data-end=\"4859\">We offer printing solutions that help bring your packaging vision to life. From minimal designs to fully printed panels, your options include:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4861\" data-end=\"5046\">\n<li data-start=\"4861\" data-end=\"4901\">\n<p data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4901\">One-color prints for subtle branding<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"4947\">\n<p data-start=\"4904\" data-end=\"4947\">CMYK full-color designs for vivid imagery<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4948\" data-end=\"4991\">\n<p data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"4991\">Logo placement on top, bottom, or sides<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4992\" data-end=\"5046\">\n<p data-start=\"4994\" data-end=\"5046\">Interior messages or QR codes for added engagement<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5121\">Our design team is available to help finalize artwork at no extra charge.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5123\" data-end=\"5126\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5172\">Why Choose Tiny Cardboard Boxes Wholesale<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"5174\" data-end=\"5208\">Bulk Orders Provide Real Value<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5210\" data-end=\"5488\">Ordering <strong data-start=\"5219\" data-end=\"5256\">tiny cardboard boxes at wholesale<\/strong> quantities allows you to lower your per-unit cost, reduce delays, and stay ready for launches or restocks. This is especially helpful for businesses that ship frequent small-batch orders or participate in high-volume retail events.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5490\" data-end=\"5660\">\n<li data-start=\"5490\" data-end=\"5527\">\n<p data-start=\"5492\" data-end=\"5527\">Reduced cost on larger quantities<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5528\" data-end=\"5568\">\n<p data-start=\"5530\" data-end=\"5568\">Less time spent reordering packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5569\" data-end=\"5616\">\n<p data-start=\"5571\" data-end=\"5616\">Consistent box quality across all shipments<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5617\" data-end=\"5660\">\n<p data-start=\"5619\" data-end=\"5660\">Time-efficient shipping and fulfillment<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5662\" data-end=\"5943\">If you&#8217;re seeking similar solutions for slightly larger items, our <strong data-start=\"5729\" data-end=\"5852\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-size-and-shape\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"5731\" data-end=\"5850\">Cardboard Boxes by Size and Shape<\/a><\/strong> helps you explore other dimensional formats that align with your packaging goals.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5945\" data-end=\"5948\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5950\" data-end=\"6000\">How to Place an Order with Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"6002\" data-end=\"6029\">Follow These Easy Steps<\/h3>\n<ol data-start=\"6031\" data-end=\"6295\">\n<li data-start=\"6031\" data-end=\"6081\">\n<p data-start=\"6034\" data-end=\"6081\">Provide your required dimensions and quantity<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6082\" data-end=\"6140\">\n<p data-start=\"6085\" data-end=\"6140\">Upload your artwork or request free design assistance<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6141\" data-end=\"6189\">\n<p data-start=\"6144\" data-end=\"6189\">Choose printing, finish, and insert options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6190\" data-end=\"6226\">\n<p data-start=\"6193\" data-end=\"6226\">Review and approve your mock-up<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6227\" data-end=\"6295\">\n<p data-start=\"6230\" data-end=\"6295\">Receive your order via free shipping within a few business days<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"6297\" data-end=\"6366\">All boxes arrive flat-packed with clear fold lines and assembly tabs.<\/p>\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-38\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"group\/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"eba1868d-0fa5-41cd-9dbe-6d90a564a876\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\">\n<h2 data-start=\"7088\" data-end=\"7146\">Why Shop Cardboard Boxes is Trusted for Small Packaging<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"7148\" data-end=\"7495\">\n<li data-start=\"7148\" data-end=\"7217\">\n<p data-start=\"7150\" data-end=\"7217\">Tiny cardboard boxes available in square, round, or custom shapes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7218\" data-end=\"7264\">\n<p data-start=\"7220\" data-end=\"7264\">Coating options: Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7265\" data-end=\"7315\">\n<p data-start=\"7267\" data-end=\"7315\">High-quality printing with free design support<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7316\" data-end=\"7359\">\n<p data-start=\"7318\" data-end=\"7359\">Strong materials to protect small items<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7360\" data-end=\"7396\">\n<p data-start=\"7362\" data-end=\"7396\">Eco-friendly materials available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7397\" data-end=\"7445\">\n<p data-start=\"7399\" data-end=\"7445\">Fast turnaround and free shipping nationwide<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7446\" data-end=\"7495\">\n<p data-start=\"7448\" data-end=\"7495\">Bulk pricing and low minimum order quantities<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"7497\" data-end=\"7618\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"7497\" data-end=\"7618\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Request a custom quote today and simplify your product packaging with Tiny Cardboard Boxes from Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/article>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes offers Tiny Cardboard Boxes at wholesale prices, designed for various packaging needs. Made from high-quality materials, these boxes provide durable solutions with a range of printing options. Custom sizes and styles are available to suit any product requirement, and we offer additional coating options like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV for a premium finish. Enjoy free design services, shipping, and fast turnaround times. Get your packaging needs sorted with us today!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2261,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[179],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2220","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-size-and-shape","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Get Tiny Cardboard Boxes At Wholeal